---
fileType: Question Text
version: CSPro 8.1
languages:
  - name: EN
    label: English
  - name: ES
    label: Español
styles:
  - name: Qtxt
    className: Qtxt
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-size: 26px;color: #000000;
  - name: Qnum
    className: Qnum
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-size: 26px;color: #000000;
  - name: Itxt
    className: Itxt
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #0000ff;
  - name: Inum
    className: Inum
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #0000ff;
  - name: QtxtC
    className: QtxtC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: QnumC
    className: QnumC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: ItxtC
    className: ItxtC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: InumC
    className: InumC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: REF
    className: REF
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #000000;
questions:
  - name: MICS7CH.UF9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">UF9. </span><span class="Itxt">Check completed questionnaires in this household: Have you or another member of your team interviewed this respondent for another questionnaire?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">UF9. </span><span class="Itxt">Marque los cuestionarios completados en este hogar: ¿Usted u otro miembro de su equipo ha entrevistado a este encuestado para otro cuestionario?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UF10
    conditions:
      - logic: UF9=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UF10B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to talk to you about <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s health and well-being in more detail.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">This interview usually takes about <span class="QtxtC">number </span>minutes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Again, participation in this survey is voluntary. No payment of incentive will be given to you for answering these questions. However, this survey will help the government and the general public better understand the situation and needs of young children.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please know that all the information you share during the interview will remain strictly confidential and anonymous. No information about you or your child will be made publicly available. We will only produce information about the general population.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Again, should you wish not to answer a question or wish to stop the interview at any point, please let me know.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If at any time you have any complaints or concerns about this survey, please use the information on the card I gave you earlier to contact <span class="QtxtC">organization name</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">May I start the interview?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UF10B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hablarte sobre la salud y el bienestar de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> con más detalle.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esta entrevista suele durar unos <span class="QtxtC">números </span>minutos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Nuevamente, la participación en esta encuesta es voluntaria. No se le otorgará ningún pago de incentivo por responder estas preguntas. Sin embargo, esta encuesta ayudará al gobierno y al público en general a comprender mejor la situación y las necesidades de los niños pequeños.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Tenga en cuenta que toda la información que comparta durante la entrevista será estrictamente confidencial y anónima. Ninguna información sobre usted o su hijo se hará pública. Sólo produciremos información sobre la población general.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Nuevamente, si no desea responder una pregunta o desea detener la entrevista en algún momento, hágamelo saber.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si en algún momento tiene alguna queja o inquietud sobre esta encuesta, utilice la información de la tarjeta que le di anteriormente para comunicarse con <span class="QtxtC">nombre de la organización</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo comenzar la entrevista?</span></p>
      - logic: UF9=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UF10A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Hello, my name is <span class="REF">~~STAFF_NAME~~</span>. We are from <span class="QtxtC">National Statistical Office</span>. We are conducting a survey about the situation of children, families and households. I would like to talk to you about <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s health and well-being.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">This interview usually takes about <span class="QtxtC">number </span>minutes.</span></p>
              <p></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Again, participation in this survey is voluntary. No payment of incentive will be given to you for answering these questions. However, this survey will help the government and the general public better understand the situation and needs of young children.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please know that all the information you share during the interview will remain strictly confidential and anonymous. No information about you or your child will be made publicly available. We will only produce information about the general population.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Should you feel uncomfortable about any questions and not wish to answer, just let me know and we can skip the question. Also, if you wish to stop the interview at any point just let me know.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If at any time you have any complaints or concerns about this survey, please use the information on the card I gave you earlier to contact <span class="QtxtC">organization name</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">May I start the interview?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UF10A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Hola, mi nombre es <span class="REF">~~STAFF_NAME~~</span>. Somos de la <span class="QtxtC">Oficina Nacional de Estadística</span>. Estamos realizando una encuesta sobre la situación de los niños, las familias y los hogares. Me gustaría hablar contigo sobre la salud y el bienestar de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esta entrevista suele durar unos <span class="QtxtC">números </span>minutos.</span></p>
              <p></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Nuevamente, la participación en esta encuesta es voluntaria. No se le otorgará ningún pago de incentivo por responder estas preguntas. Sin embargo, esta encuesta ayudará al gobierno y al público en general a comprender mejor la situación y las necesidades de los niños pequeños.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Tenga en cuenta que toda la información que comparta durante la entrevista será estrictamente confidencial y anónima. Ninguna información sobre usted o su hijo se hará pública. Sólo produciremos información sobre la población general.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si se siente incómodo con alguna pregunta y no desea responder, hágamelo saber y podremos omitir la pregunta. Además, si deseas detener la entrevista en algún momento, házmelo saber.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si en algún momento tiene alguna queja o inquietud sobre esta encuesta, utilice la información de la tarjeta que le di anteriormente para comunicarse con <span class="QtxtC">nombre de la organización</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo comenzar la entrevista?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB0
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB0. </span><span class="Qtxt">Before I begin the interview, could you please bring <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s Birth Certificate, <span class="QtxtC">National Child Immunisation Record</span>, and any immunisation record from a private health provider? We will need to refer to those documents.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB0. </span><span class="Qtxt">Antes de comenzar la entrevista, ¿podría traer el certificado de nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>, el <span class="QtxtC">Registro Nacional de Vacunación Infantil</span> y cualquier registro de vacunación de un proveedor de salud privado? Tendremos que consultar esos documentos.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB0B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB0B. </span><span class="Qtxt">What is your relationship to <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB0B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuál es su relación con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: UB1DATE
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB1. </span><span class="Qtxt">On what day, month and year was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> born?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What is his birthday?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB1.&nbsp;</span><span class="Qtxt">¿En qué día, mes y año nació <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda:</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuál es su cumpleaños?</span></p><p></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB1. </span><span class="Qtxt">On what day, month and year was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> born?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What is her birthday?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB1.&nbsp;</span><span class="Qtxt">¿En qué día, mes y año nació <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda:</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuál es ella? cumpleaños?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB1D
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">If the mother/caregiver knows the exact date of birth, also record the day; otherwise, record '98' for day.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Si la madre/cuidador sabe la fecha exacta de nacimiento, registre también el día; de lo contrario, registre '98' para el día.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">If the mother/caregiver knows the exact date of birth, also record the day; otherwise, record '98' for day.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Si la madre/cuidador sabe la fecha exacta de nacimiento, registre también el día; de lo contrario, registre '98' para el día.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB1M
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record the month</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Registrar el mes</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record the month</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Registrar el mes</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB1Y
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record the year</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Registra el año</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record the year.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Registra el año.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB2
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old is <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">How old was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> at his last birthday?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record age in completed years.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '0' if less than 1 year.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If responses to UB1 and UB2 are inconsistent, probe further and correct.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tenía <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en su último cumpleaños?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro de edad en años cumplidos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '0' si es menos de 1 año.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si las respuestas a UB1 y UB2 son inconsistentes, indague más y corrija.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old is <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">How old was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> at her last birthday?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record age in completed years.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '0' if less than 1 year.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If responses to UB1 and UB2 are inconsistent, probe further and correct.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tenía <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en su último cumpleaños?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro de edad en años cumplidos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '0' si es menos de 1 año.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si las respuestas a UB1 y UB2 son inconsistentes, indague más y corrija.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UB8
    conditions:
      - logic: UF4<>HH47 and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">I have earlier recorded that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has attended an <span class="QtxtC">Early Childhood Education programme </span>this school year. Does he currently attend this programme?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Anteriormente registré que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> asistió a un <span class="QtxtC">programa de educación infantil </span>este año escolar. ¿Asiste actualmente a este programa?</span></p>
      - logic: UF4<>HH47 and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">I have earlier recorded that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has attended an <span class="QtxtC">Early Childhood Education programme </span>this school year. Does she currently attend this programme?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Anteriormente registré que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> asistió a un <span class="QtxtC">programa de educación infantil </span>este año escolar. ¿Asiste actualmente a este programa?</span></p>
      - logic: UF4=HH47 and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">You have mentioned that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has attended an <span class="QtxtC">Early Childhood Education programme </span>this school year. Does he currently attend this programme?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Usted ha mencionado que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ha asistido a un <span class="QtxtC">programa de educación infantil </span>este año escolar. ¿Asiste actualmente a este programa?</span></p>
      - logic: UF4=HH47 and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">You have mentioned that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has attended an <span class="QtxtC">Early Childhood Education programme </span>this school year. Does she currently attend this programme?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UB8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Usted ha mencionado que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ha asistido a un <span class="QtxtC">programa de educación infantil </span>este año escolar. ¿Asiste actualmente a este programa?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UIN1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UIN1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Is <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> covered by any health insurance?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UIN1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Está <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> cubierto por algún seguro médico?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UIN2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UIN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">What type of health insurance is <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> covered by?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record all mentioned.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UIN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tipo de seguro médico cubre <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registra todo lo mencionado.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BR1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BR1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have a birth certificate?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If yes, ask: </span><span class="Qtxt">May I see it?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BR1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> un certificado de nacimiento?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">En caso afirmativo, pregunte: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo verlo?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BR2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BR2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s birth been registered with <span class="QtxtC">the civil authorities</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BR2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se ha registrado el nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ante <span class="QtxtC">las autoridades civiles</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BR3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BR3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Do you know how to register <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s birth?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BR3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Sabes cómo registrar el nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC1. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many children's books or picture books do you have for <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos libros infantiles o ilustrados tienes para <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC2A
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I am interested in learning about the things that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> plays with when he is at home.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Does he play with homemade toys, such as dolls, cars, or other toys made at home?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me interesa aprender sobre las cosas con las que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> juega cuando está en casa.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Juega con juguetes caseros, como muñecas, autos u otros juguetes hechos en casa?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I am interested in learning about the things that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> plays with when she is at home.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Does she play with homemade toys, such as dolls, cars, or other toys made at home?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me interesa aprender sobre las cosas con las que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> juega cuando está en casa.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Juega con juguetes caseros, como muñecas, autos u otros juguetes hechos en casa?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC2B
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I am interested in learning about the things that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> plays with when he is at home.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Does he play with toys from a shop or manufactured toys?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me interesa aprender sobre las cosas con las que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> juega cuando está en casa.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Juega con juguetes de una tienda o con juguetes fabricados?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I am interested in learning about the things that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> plays with when she is at home.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Does she play with toys from a shop or manufactured toys?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me interesa aprender sobre las cosas con las que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> juega cuando está en casa.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Juega con juguetes de una tienda o con juguetes fabricados?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC2C
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I am interested in learning about the things that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> plays with when he is at home.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Does he play with household objects, such as bowls or pots, or objects found outside, such as sticks, rocks, animal shells or leaves?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me interesa aprender sobre las cosas con las que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> juega cuando está en casa.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Juega con objetos domésticos, como cuencos u ollas, u objetos que encuentra en el exterior, como palos, piedras, caparazones de animales u hojas?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I am interested in learning about the things that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> plays with when she is at home.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Does she play with household objects, such as bowls or pots, or objects found outside, such as sticks, rocks, animal shells or leaves?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me interesa aprender sobre las cosas con las que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> juega cuando está en casa.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Juega con objetos del hogar, como cuencos u ollas, u objetos que se encuentran afuera, como palos, piedras, caparazones de animales u hojas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC3A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Sometimes adults taking care of children have to leave the house to go shopping, wash clothes, or for other reasons and have to leave young children.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">On how many days in the past week, that is, since last <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span> was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> left alone for more than an hour?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC3. </span><span class="Qtxt">A veces los adultos que cuidan a los niños tienen que salir de casa para ir a comprar, lavar ropa o por otros motivos y tienen que dejar a los niños pequeños.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿En cuántos días de la semana pasada, es decir, desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span>, <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> se quedó solo durante más de una hora?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC3B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Sometimes adults taking care of children have to leave the house to go shopping, wash clothes, or for other reasons and have to leave young children.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">On how many days in the past week, that is, since last <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span> was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> left in the care of another child, that is, someone less than 10 years old, for more than an hour?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC3. </span><span class="Qtxt">A veces los adultos que cuidan a los niños tienen que salir de casa para ir a comprar, lavar ropa o por otros motivos y tienen que dejar a los niños pequeños.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿En cuántos días de la semana pasada, es decir, desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span>, <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> quedó al cuidado de otro niño, es decir, alguien menor de 10 años, durante más de una hora?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, did you or any household member age 15 or over read books or look at picture books with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">A foster/step mother or father living in the household who engaged with the child should be coded as mother or father.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, ¿usted o algún miembro de su hogar de 15 años o más leyó libros o miró libros ilustrados con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Una madre adoptiva/madrastra o un padre que viva en el hogar y que interactúe con el niño debe codificarse como madre o padre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5A1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5A1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who in the household engaged in this activity with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5A1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién en el hogar realizó esta actividad con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, did you or any household member age 15 or over tell stories to <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">A foster/step mother or father living in the household who engaged with the child should be coded as mother or father.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, ¿usted o algún miembro del hogar de 15 años o más le contó historias a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Una madre adoptiva/madrastra o un padre que viva en el hogar y que interactúe con el niño debe codificarse como madre o padre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5B1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5B1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who in the household engaged in this activity with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5B1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién en el hogar realizó esta actividad con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, did you or any household member age 15 or over sing songs to or with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>, including lullabies?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">A foster/step mother or father living in the household who engaged with the child should be coded as mother or father.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, ¿usted o algún miembro de su hogar de 15 años o más ha cantado canciones para o con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>, incluidas canciones de cuna?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Una madre adoptiva/madrastra o un padre que viva en el hogar y que interactúe con el niño debe codificarse como madre o padre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5C1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5C1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who in the household engaged in this activity with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5C1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién en el hogar realizó esta actividad con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5D
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, did you or any household member age 15 or over take <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> outside the home?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">A foster/step mother or father living in the household who engaged with the child should be coded as mother or father.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, ¿usted o algún miembro del hogar de 15 años o más tomó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> fuera del hogar?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Una madre adoptiva/madrastra o un padre que viva en el hogar y que interactúe con el niño debe codificarse como madre o padre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5D1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5D1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who in the household engaged in this activity with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5D1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién en el hogar realizó esta actividad con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5E
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5E. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, did you or any household member age 15 or over play with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">A foster/step mother or father living in the household who engaged with the child should be coded as mother or father.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5E. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, ¿usted o algún miembro del hogar de 15 años o más jugó con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Una madre adoptiva/madrastra o un padre que viva en el hogar y que interactúe con el niño debe codificarse como madre o padre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5E1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5E1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who in the household engaged in this activity with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5E1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién en el hogar realizó esta actividad con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5F
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5F. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, did you or any household member age 15 or over name, count, or draw things for or with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">A foster/step mother or father living in the household who engaged with the child should be coded as mother or father.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5F. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring3~~</span>, ¿usted o algún miembro de su hogar de 15 años o más nombró, contó o dibujó cosas para o con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Una madre adoptiva/madrastra o un padre que viva en el hogar y que interactúe con el niño debe codificarse como madre o padre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC5F1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5F1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who in the household engaged in this activity with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC5F1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién en el hogar realizó esta actividad con <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC6. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to ask you about certain things <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> is currently able to do. Please keep in mind that children can develop and learn at a different pace. For example, some start talking earlier than others, or they might already say some words but not yet form sentences. So, it is fine if your child is not able to do all the things I am going to ask about. You can let me know if you have any doubts about what answer to give.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> walk on an uneven surface, for example a bumpy or steep road, without falling?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría preguntarle sobre ciertas cosas que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> puede hacer actualmente. Tenga en cuenta que los niños pueden desarrollarse y aprender a un ritmo diferente. Por ejemplo, algunos empiezan a hablar antes que otros, o es posible que ya digan algunas palabras pero aún no formen oraciones. Por lo tanto, está bien si su hijo no puede hacer todas las cosas que le voy a preguntar. Puedes dejarme saber si tienes dudas sobre qué respuesta dar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> caminar sobre una superficie irregular, por ejemplo, una carretera con baches o empinada, sin caerse?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC7
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC7. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> jump up with both feet leaving the ground?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC7. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> saltar con ambos pies levantados del suelo?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC8
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC8. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> dress himself, that is, put on <span class="QtxtC">pants and a shirt </span>without help?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> vestirse solo, es decir, ponerse <span class="QtxtC">pantalones y una camisa </span>sin ayuda?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC8. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> dress herself, that is, put on <span class="QtxtC">pants and a shirt </span>without help?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> vestirse sola, es decir, ponerse <span class="QtxtC">pantalones y una camisa </span>sin ayuda?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> fasten and unfasten buttons without help?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC9. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> abrochar y desabrochar botones sin ayuda?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC10
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> say 10 or more words like “mama” or “ball”?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC10. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> decir 10 o más palabras como “mamá” o “pelota”?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC11
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> speak using sentences of 3 or more words that go together, for example “I want water” or “The house is big”?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC11. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> hablar usando oraciones de 3 o más palabras que van juntas, por ejemplo “Quiero agua” o “La casa es grande”?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC12
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC12. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> speak using sentences of 5 or more words that go together, for example “The house is very big”?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC12. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> hablar usando oraciones de 5 o más palabras que vayan juntas, por ejemplo “La casa es muy grande”?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC13
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC13. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> correctly use any of the words “I,” “you,” “she,” or “he,” for example “I want water,” or “He eats rice”?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC13. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> utilizar correctamente alguna de las palabras “yo”, “tú”, “ella” o “él”, por ejemplo “quiero agua” o “él come arroz”?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC14
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC14. </span><span class="Qtxt">If you show <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> an object he knows well, such as a cup or animal, can he consistently name it?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">By consistently I mean that he uses the same word to refer to the same object, even if the word used is not fully correct.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Si le muestra a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> un objeto que él conoce bien, como una taza o un animal, ¿podrá nombrarlo consistentemente?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">Con consistentemente quiero decir que usa la misma palabra para referirse al mismo objeto, incluso si la palabra utilizada no es completamente correcta.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC14. </span><span class="Qtxt">If you show <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> an object she knows well, such as a cup or animal, can she consistently name it?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">By consistently I mean that she uses the same word to refer to the same object, even if the word used is not fully correct.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Si le muestra a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> un objeto que ella conoce bien, como una taza o un animal, ¿podrá nombrarlo consistentemente?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">Con consistentemente quiero decir que usa la misma palabra para referirse al mismo objeto, incluso si la palabra utilizada no es completamente correcta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC15. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> recognise at least 5 <span class="QtxtC">letters of the alphabet</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC15. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> reconocer al menos 5 <span class="QtxtC">letras del alfabeto</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC16
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> write his own name?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC16. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> escribir su propio nombre?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> write her own name?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC16. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> escribir su propio nombre?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> recognise all numbers from 1 to 5?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC17. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Reconoce <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> todos los números del 1 al 5?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC18
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC18. </span><span class="Qtxt">If you ask <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> to give you 3 objects, such as 3 stones or 3 <span class="QtxtC">beans</span>, does he give you the correct amount?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Si le pides a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> que te dé 3 objetos, como 3 piedras o 3 <span class="QtxtC">frijoles</span>, ¿te da la cantidad correcta?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC18. </span><span class="Qtxt">If you ask <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> to give you 3 objects, such as 3 stones or 3 <span class="QtxtC">beans</span>, does she give you the correct amount?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Si le pides a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> que te dé 3 objetos, como 3 piedras o 3 <span class="QtxtC">frijoles</span>, ¿te da la cantidad correcta?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> count 10 objects, for example 10 fingers or 10 blocks, without mistakes?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC19. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> contar 10 objetos, por ejemplo 10 dedos o 10 bloques, sin errores?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Can <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> do an activity, such as <span class="QtxtC">colouring or playing with building blocks</span>, without repeatedly asking for help or giving up too quickly?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC20. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puede <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> realizar una actividad, como <span class="QtxtC">colorear o jugar con bloques de construcción</span>, sin pedir ayuda repetidamente o darse por vencido demasiado rápido?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ask about familiar people other than parents when they are not there, for example “Where is <span class="QtxtC">Grandma</span>?”?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Pregunta <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> sobre personas conocidas además de los padres cuando no están presentes, por ejemplo “¿Dónde está <span class="QtxtC">abuela</span>?”?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC22
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC22. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> offer to help someone who seems to need help?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC22. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> se ofrece a ayudar a alguien que parece necesitar ayuda?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC23
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> get along well with other children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC23. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se lleva <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bien con otros niños?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC24
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC24. </span><span class="Qtxt">The next two questions have five different options for answers. I am going to read these to you after each question.</span></p>
              <span class="Qtxt">How often does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> seem to be very sad or depressed?</span><p></p>
              <span class="Qtxt">Would you say: daily, weekly, monthly, a few times a year, or never?</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Las siguientes dos preguntas tienen cinco opciones diferentes de respuesta. Voy a leerlas después de cada pregunta.</span></p>
              <span class="Qtxt">¿Con qué frecuencia <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> parece estar muy triste o deprimido?</span><p></p>
              <span class="Qtxt">¿Diría usted: diariamente, semanalmente, mensualmente, algunas veces al año o nunca?</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.EC25
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC25. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, how much does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> kick, bite, or hit other children or adults?</span></p><p></p>
              <span class="Qtxt">Would you say: not at all, less, the same, more, or a lot more?</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">EC25. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿cuánto patea, muerde o golpea <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> a otros niños o adultos?</span></p><p></p>
              <span class="Qtxt">¿Dirías: nada, menos, igual, más o mucho más?</span><p></p>
  - name: UCD2
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCD2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Adults use certain ways to teach children the right behaviour or to address a behaviour problem. I will read various methods that are used.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Please tell me if <u>you or any other adult in your household</u> has used this method with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <u>in the past month</u>.</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCD2.</span><span class="Qtxt">Los adultos utilizan ciertas formas de enseñar a los niños el comportamiento correcto o para abordar un problema de comportamiento. Leeré varios métodos que se utilizan.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Por favor, dígame si&nbsp;<u>usted o cualquier otro adulto en su hogar</u>&nbsp;ha usado este método con&nbsp;<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;<u>en el último mes</u>.</span></p><p></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCD2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Adults use certain ways to teach children the right behaviour or to address a behaviour problem. I will read various methods that are used.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Please tell me if <u>you or any other adult in your household</u> has used this method with <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <u>in the past month</u>.</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCD2.</span><span class="Qtxt">Los adultos utilizan ciertas formas de enseñar a los niños el comportamiento correcto o para abordar un problema de comportamiento. Leeré varios métodos que se utilizan.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Por favor, dígame si&nbsp;<u>usted o cualquier otro adulto en su hogar</u>&nbsp;ha usado este método con&nbsp;<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;<u>en el último mes</u>.</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2A
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Took away privileges, forbade something <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> liked or did not allow him to leave the house?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le quitó privilegios, le prohibió algo que a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> le gustaba o no le permitió salir de casa?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Took away privileges, forbade something <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> liked or did not allow her to leave the house?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le quitó privilegios, le prohibió algo que le gustaba a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> o no le permitió salir de casa?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Explained why <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s behaviour was wrong?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Explicó por qué el comportamiento de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> fue incorrecto?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2C
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Shook him?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Lo sacudiste?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Shook her?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿La sacudiste?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2D
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">Shouted, yelled at or screamed at him?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le gritaste, le gritaste o le gritaste?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">Shouted, yelled at or screamed at her?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le gritaste, le gritaste o le gritaste?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2E
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">Gave him something else to do?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le diste algo más que hacer?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">Gave her something else to do?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le diste algo más que hacer?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2F
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[F] </span><span class="Qtxt">Spanked, hit or slapped him on the bottom with bare hand?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[F] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron una palmada, un golpe o una bofetada en el trasero con las manos desnudas?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[F] </span><span class="Qtxt">Spanked, hit or slapped her on the bottom with bare hand?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[F] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿La azotaste, la golpeaste o la abofeteaste en el trasero con la mano desnuda?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2G
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[G] </span><span class="Qtxt">Hit him on the bottom or elsewhere on the body with something like a belt, hairbrush, stick or other hard object?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[G] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Golpearlo en el trasero o en otra parte del cuerpo con algo como un cinturón, cepillo para el cabello, palo u otro objeto duro?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[G] </span><span class="Qtxt">Hit her on the bottom or elsewhere on the body with something like a belt, hairbrush, stick or other hard object?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[G] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Golpearla en el trasero o en otra parte del cuerpo con algo como un cinturón, cepillo para el cabello, palo u otro objeto duro?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2H
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[H] </span><span class="Qtxt">Called him dumb, lazy or another name like that?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[H] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Lo llamaste tonto, vago u otro nombre así?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[H] </span><span class="Qtxt">Called her dumb, lazy or another name like that?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[H] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿La llamaste tonta, vaga u otro nombre así?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2I
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[I] </span><span class="Qtxt">Hit or slapped him on the face, head or ears?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[I] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Golpearlo o abofetearlo en la cara, la cabeza o las orejas?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[I] </span><span class="Qtxt">Hit or slapped her on the face, head or ears?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[I] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Golpearla o abofetearla en la cara, la cabeza o las orejas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2J
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[J] </span><span class="Qtxt">Hit or slapped him on the hand, arm, or leg?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[J] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Lo golpeó o abofeteó en la mano, el brazo o la pierna?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[J] </span><span class="Qtxt">Hit or slapped her on the hand, arm, or leg?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[J] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿La golpeó o abofeteó en la mano, el brazo o la pierna?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD2K
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[K] </span><span class="Qtxt">Beat him up, that is hit him over and over as hard as one could?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[K] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Golpearlo, es decir, golpearlo una y otra vez tan fuerte como sea posible?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[K] </span><span class="Qtxt">Beat her up, that is hit her over and over as hard as one could?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[K] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Golpearla, es decir, golpearla una y otra vez tan fuerte como sea posible?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">UCD4. </span><span class="Itxt">Check UF4: Has this respondent already responded to the following question (UCD5 or FCD5) for another child?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">UCD4. </span><span class="Itxt">Marque UF4: ¿Este encuestado ya respondió a la siguiente pregunta (UCD5 o FCD5) para otro niño?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCD5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCD5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Do you believe that in order to bring up, raise, or educate a child properly, the child needs to be physically punished?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCD5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cree que para criar, criar o educar adecuadamente a un niño, es necesario castigarlo físicamente?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF2. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to ask you some questions about difficulties <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> may have.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> wear glasses?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría hacerle algunas preguntas sobre las dificultades que puede tener <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> usa gafas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> use a hearing aid?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> utiliza un audífono?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> use any equipment or receive assistance for walking?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF4. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> utiliza algún equipo o recibe ayuda para caminar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF7
    conditions:
      - logic: UCF2=1 and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the following questions, I will ask you to answer by selecting one of four possible answers. For each question, would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that he/she cannot at all.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Repeat the categories during the individual questions whenever the respondent does not use an answer category: </span><span class="Qtxt">Remember the four possible answers: Would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that he cannot at all?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF7A. </span><span class="Qtxt">When wearing his/her glasses, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty seeing?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5. </span><span class="Qtxt">En las siguientes preguntas, le pediré que responda seleccionando una de cuatro respuestas posibles. Para cada pregunta, ¿diría que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Repita las categorías durante las preguntas individuales siempre que el encuestado no utilice una categoría de respuesta: </span><span class="Qtxt">Recuerde las cuatro posibles respuestas: ¿Diría que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF7A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando usa sus anteojos, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para ver?</span></p>
      - logic: UCF2=2 and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the following questions, I will ask you to answer by selecting one of four possible answers. For each question, would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that he/she cannot at all.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Repeat the categories during the individual questions whenever the respondent does not use an answer category: </span><span class="Qtxt">Remember the four possible answers: Would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that he cannot at all?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF7B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty seeing?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5. </span><span class="Qtxt">En las siguientes preguntas, le pediré que responda seleccionando una de cuatro respuestas posibles. Para cada pregunta, ¿diría que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Repita las categorías durante las preguntas individuales siempre que el encuestado no utilice una categoría de respuesta: </span><span class="Qtxt">Recuerde las cuatro posibles respuestas: ¿Diría que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF7B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> dificultades para ver?</span></p>
      - logic: UCF2=1 and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the following questions, I will ask you to answer by selecting one of four possible answers. For each question, would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that he/she cannot at all.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repeat the categories during the individual questions whenever the respondent does not use an answer category: </span><span class="Qtxt">Remember the four possible answers: Would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that she cannot at all?</span></p><p><span class="Qnum">UCF7A. </span><span class="Qtxt">When wearing his/her glasses, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty seeing?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5.</span><span class="Qtxt">En las siguientes preguntas, le pediré que responda seleccionando una de cuatro respuestas posibles. Para cada pregunta, ¿diría que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repita las categorías durante las preguntas individuales siempre que el encuestado no utilice una respuesta categoría:</span><span class="Qtxt">Recuerda las cuatro posibles respuestas: ¿Dirías que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto?</span></p><p><span class="Qnum">UCF7A.&nbsp;</span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando usa sus anteojos, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;tiene dificultades para ver?</span></p><p></p>
      - logic: UCF2=2 and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the following questions, I will ask you to answer by selecting one of four possible answers. For each question, would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that he/she cannot at all.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repeat the categories during the individual questions whenever the respondent does not use an answer category: </span><span class="Qtxt">Remember the four possible answers: Would you say that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> has: 1) no difficulty, 2) some difficulty, 3) a lot of difficulty, or 4) that she cannot at all?</span></p><p><span class="Qnum">UCF7B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty seeing?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF5.</span><span class="Qtxt">En las siguientes preguntas, le pediré que responda seleccionando una de cuatro respuestas posibles. Para cada pregunta, ¿diría que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repita las categorías durante las preguntas individuales siempre que el encuestado no utilice una respuesta categoría:</span><span class="Qtxt">Recuerda las cuatro posibles respuestas: ¿Dirías que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;tiene: 1) ninguna dificultad, 2) alguna dificultad, 3) mucha dificultad, o 4) que no puede en absoluto?</span></p><p><span class="Qnum">UCF7B.</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;dificultad para ver?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF9
    conditions:
      - logic: UCF3=1 and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">When using his hearing aid(s), does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty hearing sounds like people's voices or music?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando usa su(s) audífono(s), ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para escuchar sonidos como las voces de las personas o la música?</span></p>
      - logic: UCF3=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty hearing sounds like people's voices or music?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> dificultades para oír sonidos como las voces de las personas o la música?</span></p>
      - logic: UCF3=1 and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">UCF9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">When using her hearing aid(s), does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty hearing sounds like people's voices or music?</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">UCF9A.</span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando usa su(s) audífono(s), ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;tiene dificultad para escuchar sonidos como las voces de las personas o la música?</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF11
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Without his equipment or assistance, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty walking?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Sin su equipo o asistencia, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para caminar?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Without her equipment or assistance, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty walking?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Sin su equipo o asistencia, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para caminar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF12
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF12. </span><span class="Qtxt">With his equipment or assistance, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty walking?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF12. </span><span class="Qtxt">Con su equipo o asistencia, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para caminar?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF12. </span><span class="Qtxt">With her equipment or assistance, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty walking?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF12. </span><span class="Qtxt">Con su equipo o asistencia, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para caminar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF13
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF13. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty walking?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF13. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para caminar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF14
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty picking up small objects with his hand?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF14. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para levantar objetos pequeños con la mano?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty picking up small objects with her hand?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF14. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para levantar objetos pequeños con la mano?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF15. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty understanding you?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF15. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> dificultades para entenderle?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF16
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF16. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> speaks, do you have difficulty understanding him?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> habla, ¿tiene dificultades para entenderlo?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF16. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> speaks, do you have difficulty understanding her?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> habla, ¿tienes dificultades para entenderla?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty learning things?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF17. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para aprender cosas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> have difficulty playing?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF18. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tiene dificultades para jugar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.UCF19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF19. </span><span class="Qtxt">The next question has five different options for answers. I am going to read these to you after the question.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, how much does <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> kick, bite or hit other children or adults?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Would you say: not at all, less, the same, more or a lot more?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UCF19. </span><span class="Qtxt">La siguiente pregunta tiene cinco opciones diferentes de respuesta. Te los leeré después de la pregunta.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿cuánto patea, muerde o golpea <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> a otros niños o adultos?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Dirías: nada, menos, igual, más o mucho más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever been breastfed?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ha sido amamantado alguna vez?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> breastfed?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿fue amamantado <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink anything from a bottle with a nipple?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bebió algo de un biberón con tetina?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink <span class="QtxtC">Oral Rehydration Salt solution (ORS)</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <span class="QtxtC">solución de sal de rehidratación oral (SRO)</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink or eat vitamin or mineral supplements or any medicines?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió o comió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> suplementos vitamínicos o minerales o algún medicamento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you about all other liquids that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> may have had yesterday during the day or at night.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please tell me about all drinks, whether <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> had them at home, or somewhere else.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink plain water?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría preguntarte sobre todos los demás líquidos que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> pudo haber tomado ayer durante el día o la noche.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Cuéntame sobre todas las bebidas, si <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> las tomó en casa o en otro lugar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> agua corriente?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink infant formula, such as <span class="QtxtC">insert local names of common brands</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bebió fórmula infantil, como <span class="QtxtC">inserte nombres locales de marcas comunes</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7B1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7B1. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink infant formula?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7B1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces tomó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> fórmula infantil?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink milk from animals, such as fresh, tinned, or powdered milk?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> leche de animales, como leche fresca, enlatada o en polvo?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7C1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7C1. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink milk?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7C1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces bebió leche <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7C2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7C2. </span><span class="Qtxt">(Was the milk/Were any of the milk drinks) a	sweet or flavoured type of milk?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7C2. </span><span class="Qtxt">(¿Era la leche/alguna de las bebidas lácteas) un tipo de leche dulce o con sabor?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7D
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink yogurt drinks such as <span class="QtxtC">insert local names of common types of yogurt drinks</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bebió bebidas de yogur como <span class="QtxtC">inserte nombres locales de tipos comunes de bebidas de yogur</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7D1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7D1. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink yogurt drinks?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7D1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces tomó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bebidas de yogur?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7D2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7D2. </span><span class="Qtxt">(Was the yogurt drink/Were any of the yogurt drinks) a sweet or flavoured type of yogurt drink?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7D2. </span><span class="Qtxt">(¿La bebida de yogur/alguna de las bebidas de yogur era) una bebida de yogur dulce o con sabor?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7E
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7E. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink chocolate-flavoured drinks including those made from syrups or powders?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7E. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bebidas con sabor a chocolate, incluidas las elaboradas con jarabes o polvos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7F
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7F. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink fruit juice or fruit-flavoured drinks including those made from syrups or powders?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7F. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> jugos de frutas o bebidas con sabor a frutas, incluidas las elaboradas con jarabes o polvos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7G
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7G. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink sodas, malt drinks, sports drinks, or energy drinks?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7G. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> refrescos, bebidas de malta, bebidas deportivas o bebidas energéticas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7H
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7H. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink tea, coffee, or herbal drinks?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7H. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> bebió té, café o bebidas a base de hierbas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7H1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7H1. </span><span class="Qtxt">(Was the drink/Were any of these drinks) sweetened?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7H1. </span><span class="Qtxt">(¿La bebida/alguna de estas bebidas estaba) endulzada?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7I
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7I. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink clear broth or clear soup?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7I. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> caldo claro o sopa clara?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7X
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7X. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday, during the day or at night, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> drink any other liquids?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7X. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer, durante el día o la noche, ¿bebió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> algún otro líquido?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD7X2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7X2. </span><span class="Qtxt">(Was the drink/Were any of these drinks) sweetened?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD7X2. </span><span class="Qtxt">(¿La bebida/alguna de estas bebidas estaba) endulzada?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qtxt"><span class="Qnum">BD8. </span>Now I would like to ask you about <u>everything</u> that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ate yesterday during the day or at night. I am interested in all foods <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ate whether at home or somewhere else.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Think about when <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> woke up yesterday. Did he eat anything at that time?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">If 'Yes' ask: </span><span class="Qtxt">Please tell me everything <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ate at that time.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anything else?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Record answers using the food groups below.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">What did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> do after that? Did he eat anything at that time?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repeat and record with these questions, until reaching when the child woke up this morning.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">For any mixed dish, including those commercially packaged, probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What were the main ingredients in <span class="Itxt">(mixed dish)?</span></span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Record main ingredients in appropriate food groups.</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qtxt"><span class="Qnum">BD8.&nbsp;</span>Ahora me gustaría preguntarle sobre<u>todo</u>&nbsp;que<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>comió ayer durante el día o la noche. Me interesan todos los alimentos que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>como, ya sea en casa o en otro lugar.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Piensa en cuando<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;desperté ayer. ¿Comió algo en ese momento?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Si la respuesta es afirmativa, pregunte:</span><span class="Qtxt">Por favor, cuénteme todo lo que<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>comió en ese momento.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda:</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Algo más?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Registra las respuestas usando los grupos de alimentos a continuación.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué hizo<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;después de eso? ¿Comió algo a esa hora?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repita y registre con estas preguntas, hasta llegar a cuando el niño se despertó esta mañana.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Para cualquier plato mixto, incluidos los envasados comercialmente, indague:</span><span class="Qtxt">Cuáles fueron los ingredientes principales en<span class="Itxt">(plato combinado)?</span></span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Registre los ingredientes principales en los grupos de alimentos apropiados.</span></p><p></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qtxt">BD8. Now I would like to ask you about <u>everything</u> that <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ate yesterday during the day or at night. I am interested in all foods <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ate whether at home or somewhere else.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Think about when <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> woke up yesterday. Did she eat anything at that time?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">If 'Yes' ask: </span><span class="Qtxt">Please tell me everything <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ate at that time.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anything else?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Record answers using the food groups below.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">What did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> do after that? Did she eat anything at that time?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repeat and record with these questions, until reaching when the child woke up this morning.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">For any mixed dish, including those commercially packaged, probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What were the main ingredients in <span class="Itxt">(mixed dish)?</span></span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Record main ingredients in appropriate food groups.</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qtxt">BD8.&nbsp;Ahora quisiera preguntarte sobre&nbsp;<u>todo</u>&nbsp;que<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>comió ayer durante el día o la noche. Me interesan todos los alimentos que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>como, ya sea en casa o en otro lugar.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Piensa en cuando<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;desperté ayer. ¿Comió algo en ese momento?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Si la respuesta es "Sí", pregunte:&nbsp;</span><span class="Qtxt">Por favor, cuénteme todo lo que<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;comió en ese momento.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda:</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Algo más?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Registra las respuestas usando los grupos de alimentos a continuación.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué hizo<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;después de eso? ¿Comió algo a esa hora?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Repita y registre con estas preguntas, hasta llegar a cuando el niño se despertó esta mañana.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Para cualquier plato mixto, incluidos los envasados comercialmente, indague:</span><span class="Qtxt">Cuáles fueron los ingredientes principales en<span class="Itxt">(plato combinado)?</span></span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Registre los ingredientes principales en los grupos de alimentos apropiados.</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat yogurt, other than yogurt drinks yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Note that liquid/drinking yogurt should be captured in BD7D.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarnos, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió yogur, aparte de bebidas de yogur, ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Tenga en cuenta que el yogur líquido o para beber debe capturarse en BD7D.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8A1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8A1. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat yogurt?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8A1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió yogur?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat porridge, bread, rice, noodles, pasta, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly consumed grains and foods made from grains</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguro, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió gachas, pan, arroz, fideos, pasta o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otros cereales y alimentos elaborados a partir de cereales que se consumen habitualmente</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat pumpkin, carrots, sweet red peppers, squash, or sweet potatoes that are yellow or orange inside yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarnos, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió calabaza, zanahorias, pimientos rojos dulces, calabacines o batatas que son amarillas o anaranjadas por dentro ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8D
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat plantains, white potatoes, white yams, manioc, cassava, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly consumed starchy tubers or starchy tuberous roots that are white or pale inside</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió plátanos, papas blancas, ñames blancos, mandioca, mandioca o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otros tubérculos con almidón o raíces tuberosas con almidón de consumo común que son blancos o pálidos por dentro</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8E
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8E. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat dark green, leafy vegetables, such as <span class="QtxtC">insert commonly consumed vitamin A-rich dark green leafy vegetables</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8E. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió verduras de hojas verdes oscuras, como <span class="QtxtC">inserte verduras de hojas verdes oscuras ricas en vitamina A</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8F
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8F. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat any other vegetables, such as <span class="QtxtC">insert commonly consumed vegetables</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8F. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarnos, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió otras verduras, como <span class="QtxtC">inserte verduras de consumo común</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8G
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8G. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat ripe mangoes, ripe papayas, or <span class="QtxtC">insert commonly consumed vitamin A-rich fruits</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8G. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió mangos maduros, papayas maduras o <span class="QtxtC">insertó frutas ricas en vitamina A que se consumen habitualmente</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8H
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8H. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat any other fruits such as <span class="QtxtC">insert commonly consumed fruits</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8H. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió otras frutas como <span class="QtxtC">inserte frutas de consumo común</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8I
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8I. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat liver, kidney, heart, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly consumed organ meats</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8I. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió hígado, riñón, corazón o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otras vísceras comúnmente consumidas</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8J
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8J. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat sausages, hot dogs, ham, bacon, salami, canned meat, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly consumed processed meats</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8J. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguro, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió salchichas, hot dogs, jamón, tocino, salami, carne enlatada o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otras carnes procesadas de consumo común</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8K
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8K. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat any other meat, such as beef, pork, lamb, goat, chicken, duck, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly 	consumed meat</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8K. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió alguna otra carne, como carne de res, cerdo, cordero, cabra, pollo, pato, o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otra carne de consumo común</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8L
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8L. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat eggs yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8L. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió huevos ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8M
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8M. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat fresh fish, dried fish, or shellfish yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8M. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió pescado fresco, pescado seco o mariscos ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8N
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8N. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat beans, peas, lentils, nuts, seeds, or <span class="QtxtC">insert commonly consumed foods made from these</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8N. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguro, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió frijoles, guisantes, lentejas, nueces, semillas o <span class="QtxtC">insertó alimentos de consumo común elaborados con estos</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8O
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8O. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat hard or soft cheese such as <span class="QtxtC">insert commonly consumed types of cheese</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8O. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguro, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió queso duro o blando como <span class="QtxtC">inserte los tipos de queso que se consumen comúnmente</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8P
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8P. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat sweet foods such as chocolates, candies, pastries, cakes, biscuits, or frozen treats like ice cream and popsicles, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly consumed sentinel sweet foods</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8P. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarnos, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió alimentos dulces como chocolates, caramelos, pasteles, bizcochos o golosinas congeladas como helados y paletas heladas, o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otros alimentos dulces centinela de consumo común</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8Q
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8Q. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat chips, crisps, puffs, French fries, fried dough, instant noodles, or <span class="QtxtC">insert other commonly 	consumed sentinel fried and salty foods</span> yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8Q. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguro, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió papas fritas, patatas fritas, hojaldres, papas fritas, masa frita, fideos instantáneos o <span class="QtxtC">insertó otros alimentos fritos y salados centinela de consumo común</span> ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD8X
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8X. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat other solid, semi-solid, or soft food yesterday during the day or at night?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD8X. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para estar seguros, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió otros alimentos sólidos, semisólidos o blandos ayer durante el día o la noche?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.BD9
    conditions:
      - logic: BD8A<>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday during the day or at night, how many times did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat any solid, semi-solid or soft foods?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer durante el día o la noche, ¿cuántas veces <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió algún alimento sólido, semisólido o blando?</span></p>
      - logic: BD8A=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Yesterday during the day or at night, how many times did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> eat any solid, semi-solid or soft foods?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Ensure that the response here includes the number of times recorded for yogurt in BD8A1.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BD9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ayer durante el día o la noche, ¿cuántas veces <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> comió algún alimento sólido, semisólido o blando?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Asegúrese de que la respuesta aquí incluya el número de veces registradas para el yogur en BD8A1.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Do you have a <span class="QtxtC">National Child Immunization Record</span>, immunization records from a private health provider or any other document where <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>'s vaccinations are written down?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tienes un <span class="QtxtC">Carta Nacional de Vacunación Infantil</span>, cartilla de vacunación de un proveedor privado de salud o algún otro documento donde consten las vacunas de <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you ever have a <span class="QtxtC">National Child Immunization Record</span> or immunization records from a private health provider for <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguna vez tuvo un <span class="QtxtC">Registro Nacional de Vacunación Infantil</span> o registros de vacunación de un proveedor de salud privado para <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM5. </span><span class="Qtxt">May I see the card(s) (and/or) other document?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo ver la(s) tarjeta(s) (y/u) otro documento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM5AD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">IM5A. </span><span class="Itxt">Record day of birth from the card and/or other document.</span></p>
              <span class="Itxt">Record ‘98’ for any missing or illegible information.</span>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">IM5A. </span><span class="Itxt">Registre el día de nacimiento en la cédula y/u otro documento.</span></p>
              <span class="Itxt">Registre '98' para cualquier información faltante o ilegible.</span>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM5AM
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">IM5A. </span><span class="Itxt">Record month of birth from the card and/or other document.</span></p>
              <span class="Itxt">Record ‘98’ for any missing or illegible information.</span>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">IM5A. </span><span class="Itxt">Registrar el mes de nacimiento en la cédula y/u otro documento.</span></p>
              <span class="Itxt">Registre '98' para cualquier información faltante o ilegible.</span>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM5AY
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">IM5A. </span><span class="Itxt">Record year of birth from the card and/or other document.</span></p>
              <span class="Itxt">Record ‘9998’ for any missing or illegible information.</span>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">IM5A. </span><span class="Itxt">Anotar el año de nacimiento en la cédula y/u otro documento.</span></p>
              <span class="Itxt">Registre '9998' para cualquier información faltante o ilegible.</span>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM6D
    conditions:
      - logic: visualIM9<>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: day</span></p>
              <p><br/></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: día</span></p>
              <p><br/></p>
      - logic: visualIM9=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: day</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '66' in the corresponding day column for each vaccine not in the card but reported by the mother.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: día</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '66' en la columna del día correspondiente para cada vacuna que no esté en la tarjeta pero que haya sido reportada por la madre.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM6M
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: month</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: mes</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM6Y
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: year</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">~~getocclabel(IM6(curocc()))~~: año</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM8A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> participate in <span class="QtxtC">insert date/type of campaign A, antigens</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en <span class="QtxtC">insertar fecha/tipo de campaña A, antígenos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM8B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> participate in<span class="QtxtC"> insert date/type of campaign B, antigens</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM8B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en<span class="QtxtC"> insertar fecha/tipo de campaña B, antígenos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM8C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM8C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> participate in<span class="QtxtC"> insert date/type of campaign C, antigens</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM8C. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en<span class="QtxtC"> insertar fecha/tipo de campaña C, antígenos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM9. </span><span class="Qtxt">In addition to what is recorded on the document(s) you have shown me, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> receive any other vaccinations including vaccinations received during <span class="QtxtC">the campaigns, immunization days or child health days</span> just mentioned?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Además de lo que consta en el(los) documento(s) que me ha mostrado, ¿recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna otra vacuna, incluidas las vacunas recibidas durante <span class="QtxtC">las campañas, jornadas de vacunación o jornadas de salud infantil</span> que acabamos de mencionar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM11
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever receive any vaccinations to prevent him from getting diseases, including vaccinations received in a <span class="QtxtC">campaign, immunisation day or child health day</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM11. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vacuna para evitar contraer enfermedades, incluidas las vacunas recibidas en una <span class="QtxtC">campaña, jornada de vacunación o jornada de salud infantil</span>?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received any vaccinations to prevent her from getting diseases, including vaccinations received in a <span class="QtxtC">campaign, immunisation day or child health day</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM11. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vacuna para evitar contraer enfermedades, incluidas las vacunas recibidas en una <span class="QtxtC">campaña, jornada de vacunación o jornada de salud infantil</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM12A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM12A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> participate in <span class="QtxtC">insert date/type of campaign A, antigens</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM12A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en <span class="QtxtC">insertar fecha/tipo de campaña A, antígenos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM12B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM12B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> participate in <span class="QtxtC">insert date/type of campaign B, antigens</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM12B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en <span class="QtxtC">insertar fecha/tipo de campaña B, antígenos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM12C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM12C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> participate in <span class="QtxtC">insert date/type of campaign C, antigens</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM12C. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> en <span class="QtxtC">insertar fecha/tipo de campaña C, antígenos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM14
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a BCG vaccination against tuberculosis - that is, an injection in the arm or shoulder that usually causes a scar?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM14. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez la vacuna BCG contra la tuberculosis, es decir, una inyección en el brazo o en el hombro que suele dejar una cicatriz?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM15. </span><span class="Qtxt">At or soon after birth, did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> receive a Hepatitis B vaccination, that is, an injection on the outside of the thigh to prevent Hepatitis B?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM15. </span><span class="Qtxt">Al nacer o poco después, ¿recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> una vacuna contra la hepatitis B, es decir, una inyección en la parte exterior del muslo para prevenir la hepatitis B?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM15A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM15A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> receive it within 24 hours of birth?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM15A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Lo recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> dentro de las 24 horas posteriores al nacimiento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM16
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received oral polio vaccine, that is, about two drops in the mouth to prevent polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that this vaccine is often called OPV, and that the first dose can be given at birth and/or later at the same time as injections to prevent other diseases.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM16. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez la vacuna oral contra la polio, es decir, unas dos gotas en la boca para prevenir la polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Indague indicando que esta vacuna a menudo se llama OPV, y que la primera dosis se puede administrar al nacer y/o más tarde al mismo tiempo que las inyecciones para prevenir otras enfermedades.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received any vaccination drops in the mouth to protect her from polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that the first drop is usually given at birth and later at the same time as injections to prevent other diseases.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM16. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez gotas de vacuna en la boca para protegerla de la polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Indaga indicando que la primera gota se suele dar al nacer y posteriormente al mismo tiempo que las inyecciones para prevenir otras enfermedades.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> receive the first oral polio vaccine in the first two weeks after birth or later?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM17. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> la primera vacuna oral contra la polio en las dos primeras semanas después del nacimiento o más tarde?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM18. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times was the oral polio vaccine received?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM18. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces se recibió la vacuna oral contra la polio?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM19
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received an injected polio vaccine, that is, an injection in the arm to protect against polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that this vaccine is often called IPV, and that the injection can be given at the same time as the oral polio vaccine and/or other injections.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM19. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna contra la polio inyectada, es decir, una inyección en el brazo para proteger contra la polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que esta vacuna a menudo se llama IPV y que la inyección se puede administrar al mismo tiempo que la vacuna oral contra la polio y/u otras inyecciones.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM19. </span><span class="Qtxt">The last time <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> received the polio drops, did she also get an injection to protect against polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe to ensure that both were given, drops and injection.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM19. </span><span class="Qtxt">La última vez que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> recibió las gotas contra la polio, ¿recibió también una inyección para protegerse contra la polio?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda para asegurarse de que se administraron ambos, gotas e inyección.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM19A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM19A. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times was the injected polio vaccine received?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM19A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces se recibió la vacuna contra la polio inyectada?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM20
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a Pentavalent vaccination, that is, an injection in the thigh to prevent him from getting tetanus, whooping cough, diphtheria, Hepatitis B disease, and Haemophilus influenzae type b?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that the Pentavalent vaccination is sometimes given at the same time as the Polio drops.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM20. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna pentavalente, es decir, una inyección en el muslo para evitar contraer tétanos, tos ferina, difteria, hepatitis B y Haemophilus influenzae tipo b?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Indague indicando que la vacuna pentavalente a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que baja la polio.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a Pentavalent vaccination, that is, an injection in the thigh to prevent her from getting tetanus, whooping cough, diphtheria, Hepatitis B disease, and Haemophilus influenzae type b?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that Pentavalent vaccination is sometimes given at the same time as the Polio drops.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM20. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna pentavalente, es decir, una inyección en el muslo para evitar contraer tétanos, tos ferina, difteria, hepatitis B y Haemophilus influenzae tipo b?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que la vacuna pentavalente a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que baja la polio.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM21. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times was the Pentavalent vaccine received?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces se recibió la vacuna Pentavalente?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM22
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM22. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a pneumococcal vaccination, that is, an injection in the thigh to prevent pneumonia?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that pneumococcal vaccination is sometimes given at the same time as the Pentavalent vaccination.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM22. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna neumocócica, es decir, una inyección en el muslo para prevenir la neumonía?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que la vacuna neumocócica a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que la vacuna pentavalente.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM23
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM23. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times was the pneumococcal vaccine received?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM23. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces se recibió la vacuna antineumocócica?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM24
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a rotavirus vaccination, that is, liquid in the mouth to prevent diarrhoea?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that rotavirus vaccination is sometimes given at the same time as the Pentavalent vaccination.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM24. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna contra el rotavirus, es decir, líquido en la boca para prevenir la diarrea?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que la vacuna contra el rotavirus a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que la vacuna pentavalente.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM25
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM25. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times was the rotavirus vaccine received?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM25. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces se recibió la vacuna contra rotavirus?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM26
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM26. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a <span class="QtxtC">MMR/MR </span>vaccine, that is, an injection in the arm to prevent him from getting <span class="QtxtC">measles, mumps and rubella</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM26. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna <span class="QtxtC">triple/MR</span>, es decir, una inyección en el brazo para evitar que contraiga <span class="QtxtC">sarampión, paperas y rubéola</span>?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM26. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received a <span class="QtxtC">MMR/MR </span>vaccine, that is, an injection in the arm to prevent her from getting <span class="QtxtC">measles, mumps and rubella</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM26. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez una vacuna <span class="QtxtC">triple/MR</span>, es decir, una inyección en el brazo para evitar que contraiga <span class="QtxtC">sarampión, paperas y rubéola</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM26A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM26A. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times was the <span class="QtxtC">MMR/MR</span> vaccine received?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM26A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces se recibió la vacuna <span class="QtxtC">MMR/MR</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM27
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received the Yellow Fever vaccination, that is, a shot in the arm at the age of 9 months or older to prevent him from getting Yellow Fever?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that the Yellow Fever vaccine is sometimes given at the same time as the <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR</span> vaccine.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez la vacuna contra la fiebre amarilla, es decir, una inyección en el brazo a la edad de 9 meses o más para evitar que contraiga fiebre amarilla?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que la vacuna contra la fiebre amarilla a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que la vacuna <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR</span>.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received the Yellow Fever vaccination, that is, a shot in the arm at the age of 9 months or older to prevent her from getting Yellow Fever?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that the Yellow Fever vaccine is sometimes given at the same time as the <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR</span> vaccine.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27.</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span>&nbsp;alguna vez la vacuna contra la Fiebre Amarilla, es decir, una inyección en el brazo a la edad de 9 meses o más para evitar que contraiga Fiebre Amarilla?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda indicando que la vacuna contra la fiebre amarilla a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que la vacuna <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR</span>.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.IM27A
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received the Td Booster, that is, an injection in the thigh at the age of 1 year or older, to boost his immunity against diphtheria and tetanus?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that the first Td Booster is sometimes given at the same time as the second <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR </span>dose.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez el Td Booster, es decir, una inyección en el muslo a la edad de 1 año o más, para reforzar su inmunidad contra la difteria y el tétanos?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que el primer refuerzo de Td a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que la segunda dosis de <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR </span>.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ever received the Td Booster, that is, an injection in the thigh at the age of 1 year or older, to boost her immunity against diphtheria and tetanus?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe by indicating that the first Td Booster is sometimes given at the same time as the second <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR </span>dose.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">IM27A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha recibido <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> alguna vez el Td Booster, es decir, una inyección en el muslo a la edad de 1 año o más, para aumentar su inmunidad contra la difteria y el tétanos?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue indicando que el primer refuerzo de Td a veces se administra al mismo tiempo que la segunda dosis de <span class="ItxtC">MMR/MR </span>.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA1. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the last two weeks, has <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> had diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA1. </span><span class="Qtxt">En las últimas dos semanas, ¿<span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> ha tenido diarrea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA3
    conditions:
      - logic: (UB2>=2 or (UB2<2 and (BD3=1 or BD2=8 or BD3=8))) and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3A. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to know how much <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> was given to drink during the diarrhoea, including breastmilk. Was he given less than usual to drink, about the same amount, or more than usual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'less', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was he given much less than usual to drink, or somewhat less?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría saber cuánto <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> se le dio de beber durante la diarrea, incluida la leche materna. ¿Le dieron de beber menos de lo habitual, aproximadamente la misma cantidad o más de lo habitual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'menos', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron de beber mucho menos de lo habitual, o un poco menos?</span></p>
      - logic: (UB2<2 and (BD2=2 or BD3=2)) and chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3B. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to know how much <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> was given to drink during the diarrhoea. Was he given less than usual to drink, about the same amount, or more than usual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'less', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was he given much less than usual to drink, or somewhat less?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría saber cuánto <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> le dieron de beber durante la diarrea. ¿Le dieron de beber menos de lo habitual, aproximadamente la misma cantidad o más de lo habitual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'menos', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron de beber mucho menos de lo habitual, o un poco menos?</span></p>
      - logic: (UB2>=2 or (UB2<2 and (BD3=1 or BD2=8 or BD3=8))) and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3A. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to know how much <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> was given to drink during the diarrhoea, including breastmilk. Was she given less than usual to drink, about the same amount, or more than usual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'less', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was she given much less than usual to drink, or somewhat less?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría saber cuánto <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> se le dio de beber durante la diarrea, incluida la leche materna. ¿Le dieron de beber menos de lo habitual, aproximadamente la misma cantidad o más de lo habitual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'menos', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron de beber mucho menos de lo habitual, o un poco menos?</span></p>
      - logic: (UB2<2 and (BD2=2 or BD3=2)) and chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3B. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to know how much <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> was given to drink during the diarrhoea. Was she given less than usual to drink, about the same amount, or more than usual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'less', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was she given much less than usual to drink, or somewhat less?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA3B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría saber cuánto <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> le dieron de beber durante la diarrea. ¿Le dieron de beber menos de lo habitual, aproximadamente la misma cantidad o más de lo habitual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'menos', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron de beber mucho menos de lo habitual, o un poco menos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA4
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA4. </span><span class="Qtxt">During the time <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> had diarrhoea, was he given less than usual to eat, about the same amount, more than usual, or nothing to eat?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'less', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was he given much less than usual to eat or somewhat less?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante el tiempo que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tuvo diarrea, ¿le dieron de comer menos de lo habitual, aproximadamente la misma cantidad, más de lo habitual o nada para comer?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'menos', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron mucho menos de lo habitual para comer o un poco menos?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA4. </span><span class="Qtxt">During the time <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> had diarrhoea, was she given less than usual to eat, about the same amount, more than usual, or nothing to eat?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'less', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was she given much less than usual to eat or somewhat less?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante el tiempo que <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tuvo diarrea, ¿le dieron de comer menos de lo habitual, aproximadamente la misma cantidad, más de lo habitual o nada para comer?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'menos', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron mucho menos de lo habitual para comer o un poco menos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you seek any advice or treatment for the diarrhoea from any source?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Buscó algún consejo o tratamiento para la diarrea de alguna fuente?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Where did you seek advice or treatment?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anywhere else?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record all providers mentioned, but do <u>not</u> prompt with any suggestions.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe to identify each type of provider.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>If unable to determine whether public, private, or NGO</u>, write the name of the place and then temporarily record ‘W’ until you learn the appropriate category for the response.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA6. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dónde buscó asesoramiento o tratamiento?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿En algún otro lugar?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registra todos los proveedores mencionados, pero <u>no</u> solicita sugerencias.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda para identificar cada tipo de proveedor.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>Si no puede determinar si es público, privado u ONG</u>, escriba el nombre del lugar y luego registre temporalmente "W" hasta que aprenda la categoría apropiada para la respuesta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA8
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA8. </span><span class="Qtxt">Where did you first seek advice or treatment?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>If unable to determine whether public, private, or NGO in DA6</u>, temporarily record ‘76’ until you learn the appropriate category for the response.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dónde buscó consejo o tratamiento por primera vez?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>Si no puede determinar si es público, privado u ONG en DA6</u>, registre temporalmente '76' hasta que sepa la categoría adecuada para la respuesta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA9A
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given a fluid made from a special packet called <span class="QtxtC">insert local name for ORS packet solution</span> at any time since he started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se le dio a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> un líquido elaborado a partir de un paquete especial llamado <span class="QtxtC">inserte el nombre local de la solución en paquete de SRO</span> en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given a fluid made from a special packet called <span class="QtxtC">insert local name for ORS packet solution</span> at any time since she started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se le dio a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> un líquido elaborado a partir de un paquete especial llamado <span class="QtxtC">inserte el nombre local de la solución en paquete de SRO</span> en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA9B
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given <span class="QtxtC">insert local name for pre-packaged ORS liquids</span> or other pre-packaged ORS liquid at any time since he started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <span class="QtxtC">insertar el nombre local de las SRO líquidas preenvasadas</span> u otro líquido de SRO preenvasado en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given <span class="QtxtC">insert local name for pre-packaged ORS liquids</span> or other pre-packaged ORS liquid at any time since she started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibió <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <span class="QtxtC">insertar el nombre local de las SRO líquidas preenvasadas</span> u otro líquido de SRO preenvasado en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA9C
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given zinc tablets or syrup at any time since he started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9C. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tabletas o jarabe de zinc en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given zinc tablets or syrup at any time since she started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9C. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> tabletas o jarabe de zinc en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA9D
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given <span class="QtxtC">insert government-recommended homemade 	fluid</span> at any time since he started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9D. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le dieron a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <span class="QtxtC">inserte líquido casero recomendado por el gobierno</span> en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9D. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> given <span class="QtxtC">insert government-recommended homemade 	fluid</span> at any time since she started having diarrhoea?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DA9D. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se le administró a <span class="REF">~~UF3N~~</span> <span class="QtxtC">inserte líquido casero recomendado por el gobierno</span> en algún momento desde que comenzó a tener diarrea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7CH.DA10
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
